00:27:16.520 --> 00:27:19.360
detainees can be seen being dragged across the floor,

00:27:19.680 --> 00:27:21.760
hit and squeezed into cells.

00:27:30.080 --> 00:27:34.160
It's a very bleak place.
There are no lights.

00:27:34.480 --> 00:27:38.000
You don't know what time it is, if it's day or night.

00:27:38.400 --> 00:27:41.280
You have no way to tell how much time has passed.

00:27:43.080 --> 00:27:45.680
At the end of November 2022,

00:27:45.720 --> 00:27:48.640
the young human rights activist was arrested at home,

00:27:49.000 --> 00:27:52.400
and this time she was taken by force to a secret detention centre.

00:27:53.440 --> 00:27:59.840
I was blindfolded the whole time.
I was harassed and tortured.

00:28:00.560 --> 00:28:06.960
They made me take off my clothes,
in fact, they took them off by force.

00:28:07.600 --> 00:28:10.560
They started to humiliate me by mocking my body.

00:28:11.360 --> 00:28:19.360
They said my skin was ugly
and then they started to touch me...

00:28:23.720 --> 00:28:25.840
Elaye was a victim of sexual assault.

00:28:26.880 --> 00:28:28.080
I'm really sorry.

00:28:30.960 --> 00:28:35.440
These pro-regime militia,
whatever they're fucking called,

00:28:36.800 --> 00:28:42.240
what they want is to destroy the souls of women
and scare others.

00:28:44.640 --> 00:28:46.640
The regime is only holding on through fear.

00:28:46.800 --> 00:28:51.760
It's important to understand that this is
a psychological war led by the regime

00:28:52.160 --> 00:28:56.480
against its own citizens
to eventually establish a regime of terror.

00:28:58.000 --> 00:29:02.440
This sexual violence and mass imprisonment has one precise goal,

00:29:02.920 --> 00:29:04.800
to terrorise the people of Iran.

00:29:05.320 --> 00:29:07.040
And the regime has gone even further.

00:29:07.520 --> 00:29:09.640
It makes heavy use of the death penalty.

00:29:15.400 --> 00:29:17.000
It often takes place in public.

00:29:17.680 --> 00:29:20.440
Many of the condemned are hanged using a crane.

00:29:21.200 --> 00:29:23.000
In 2022 alone,

00:29:23.320 --> 00:29:26.240
at least 582 people were executed.

00:29:26.800 --> 00:29:29.440
Among them were some very young protesters.

00:29:31.280 --> 00:29:31.680
22-year-old

00:29:32.120 --> 00:29:34.720
Mohamed Mahdi Karami was a karateka.

00:29:34.720 --> 00:29:41.120
23-year-old Mohsen Sheikha was a waiter in a cafe.

00:29:41.720 --> 00:29:41.880
And

00:29:42.640 --> 00:29:43.080
23-year-old...

00:29:43.560 --> 00:29:46.720
Majee Reza Ranavad was a fruit and vegetable seller.

00:29:47.160 --> 00:29:50.480
He was executed on the 12th of December 2022.

00:29:56.640 --> 00:30:00.000
None of the people who were publicly hanged had the right to a fair trial.

00:30:00.440 --> 00:30:01.200
And because of this,

00:30:01.560 --> 00:30:03.680
Iranian lawyers are also targeted.

00:30:06.480 --> 00:30:10.520
There's your photo.
With the hijab.

