00:31:32.880 --> 00:31:38.640
We were ready to go to prison.

00:31:40.480 --> 00:31:41.600
The threats were serious.

00:31:42.200 --> 00:31:46.080
Ehsan regularly receives calls for help from his colleagues who are still in Iran.

