00:32:01.120 --> 00:32:08.480
Over the course of these past few months, you know,
more than 50 lawyers have been arrested in Iran

00:32:08.640 --> 00:32:14.800
and tortured just for defending
political prisoners in Iran:

00:32:16.800 --> 00:32:18.920
According to Ehsan Hosseinzadeh,

00:32:19.360 --> 00:32:22.120
