00:32:26.240 --> 00:32:28.080
These people aren't criminals.

00:32:28.240 --> 00:32:31.920
They're citizens who wanted to protest
against the regime,

00:32:32.400 --> 00:32:41.280
but the regime can't accept
that 80% of its society are against them.

00:32:43.360 --> 00:32:44.800
And to judge the protesters,

00:32:45.080 --> 00:32:47.560
the regime uses special jurisdictions,

00:32:48.120 --> 00:32:49.920
