Iran projects threat to the UK directly through its aggressive intelligence services.

00:35:23.840 --> 00:35:24.600
At its sharpest,

00:35:25.240 --> 00:35:27.440
this includes ambitions to kidnap or even kill

00:35:27.920 --> 00:35:31.440
British or UK-based individuals perceived as enemies of the regime.

00:35:32.920 --> 00:35:36.360
We've seen at least 10 such potential threats since January alone.

00:35:37.040 --> 00:35:44.800
No Iranian opponent can feel 100% at ease and safe
whether they're in New York, Paris or London.

00:35:48.520 --> 00:35:49.240
Unbelievably,

