00:40:11.920 --> 00:40:14.200
the Islamic Revolutionary Guard Corps.

00:40:24.600 --> 00:40:25.400
This elite group,

00:40:25.640 --> 00:40:28.160
made up of 125,000 men,

00:40:28.680 --> 00:40:31.040
has land force and even its own marine.

00:40:32.280 --> 00:40:33.440
In 2019,

00:40:33.520 --> 00:40:38.400
the American government listed the paramilitary group as a terrorist organization.

00:40:48.240 --> 00:40:52.000
Islamic Revolutionary Guard Corps Land Forces

00:40:53.920 --> 00:40:56.600
The Islamic Revolutionary Guards have no limit.

00:40:57.320 --> 00:41:04.640
They have no problem directly threatening citizens of Western countries that dare to criticize the Islamic Republic.

00:41:05.400 --> 00:41:07.520
In January 2023,

00:41:07.520 --> 00:41:12.160
when Charlie Hebdo published caricatures of Iranian dignitaries entitled,

00:41:12.360 --> 00:41:12.720
Mullahs,

00:41:13.080 --> 00:41:14.400
Go Back Where You Came From,

00:41:15.080 --> 00:41:16.840
The commander-in-chief of the guards,

00:41:17.200 --> 00:41:17.960
General Salami,

00:41:18.440 --> 00:41:23.600
named the journalists of the weekly publication as targets and called for them to be killed.

00:41:23.760 --> 00:41:28.640
The objective of the Revolutionary Guard Corps
is to protect the regime.

00:41:28.880 --> 00:41:31.760
In that way, it's an ideological army.

00:41:31.920 --> 00:41:34.160
In any case, their name says it all:

00:41:34.320 --> 00:41:38.160
they're the Islamic Revolutionary Guard Corps
not the Iranian Guard Corps.

00:41:38.320 --> 00:41:41.360
The Revolutionary Guards were created
to protect the system.

00:41:44.160 --> 00:41:45.800
As well as protecting the regime,

00:41:46.080 --> 00:41:50.640
the Revolutionary Guards also defend the particular interests of Iranian leaders.

00:41:51.360 --> 00:41:54.240
They have a stranglehold on all key sectors of the economy.

00:41:58.000 --> 00:41:58.680
For this reason,

00:41:58.760 --> 00:42:00.840
they've created several holding companies,

00:42:01.280 --> 00:42:03.120
such as Khatam al-Anbija,

00:42:03.560 --> 00:42:05.920
which is worth more than $10 billion.

00:42:05.920 --> 00:42:10.040
Khatam al-Anbija Reconstruction Headquarters has moved towards super projects.

00:42:12.280 --> 00:42:12.880
This company,

00:42:13.040 --> 00:42:14.480
with its opaque finances,

00:42:14.920 --> 00:42:16.400
manages oil and gas fields,

00:42:16.760 --> 00:42:19.040
hydro dams and even public transport.

00:42:20.640 --> 00:42:22.800
These days, we're talking about
60% of the Iranian economy

00:42:22.960 --> 00:42:24.800
being in the hands of the Revolutionary Guards

00:42:24.960 --> 00:42:30.880
via companies that are directly affiliated with them
or companies that are closely linked to them.

00:42:31.040 --> 00:42:34.800
Clearly in Iran, it's very difficult to do business

00:42:34.960 --> 00:42:39.200
without identifying yourself to the Revolutionary
Guards, and without them profiting.

00:42:39.520 --> 00:42:44.000
In Iran, you can't really invest
you can't do anything if you're an entrepreneur

00:42:44.160 --> 00:42:48.000
or a big businessman
without the regime allowing you.

00:42:49.880 --> 00:42:51.240
This monopoly on wealth,

00:42:51.520 --> 00:42:54.720
held by the dignitaries of the regime who were extremely corrupt,

00:42:55.080 --> 00:43:00.200
is one of the causes of the extreme poverty that affects almost one in two Iranians today.

